  "remarks": "TAi.023 Title: Mullah. Designation: Deputy Chief of Army Staff of the Taliban regime (1996-2001).  Afghanistan diplomatic passport D0009726, issued on 13 Oct. 2021, issued in Kabul, Afghanistan, expires 13 Oct. 2026. (Name in Latin script: Mohammad Fadel Aakhund; name in original script: محمد فاضل آخوند). Missing left leg since 1996. Serious injury on his right foot. Height 168 cm.; Listing: Listed on 23 Feb. 2001 (amended on 3 Sep. 2003, 21 Sep. 2007, 3 Oct. 2008 and 31 Dec. 2013, 7 Sep. 2016, 10 Mar. 2026, 28 Apr. 2026)",
